set_option linter.unusedVariables false

/-!
# A350260

Triangle read by rows. T(n, k) = k^n * BellPolynomial(n, 1/k) for k > 0, if k = 0 then T(n, k) = k^n.

The 45 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `0`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A350260

